# parent directory is excluded - so anything genuinely needed under bin/x64 has
# to be added with `git add -f`. Everything currently tracked there predates this
# rule. Adding Packages/data-packages/*.json in PR #4 looked like it worked and
# silently did nothing; tools/extract_language_data.py now checks for that.
